This is the story of how Angelina and her stepfather became members of The Higher Society. 

You play the the role of the stepfather. As a respected actor in Hollywood, you get the opportunity to join THS. This is a secret society made up of some of L.A."s most powerful people. It is also a society that is based on traditional gender role patterns and a strict hierarchy. A society full of money, power and beautiful women may seem alluring, but can you combine this life with being a husband and father? Your relationship with your daughter is put to the test when she shows interest in both THS and you...​

